ource=3Dcustomer.io )

=E2=80=83

Hi Patrio Gabriel,

Every provider behind OpenRouter has its own retention and training policy.=
 OpenRouter reflects those policies as structured data on each endpoint, pu=
blishes the full table in the docs, and gives you controls to filter routin=
g on them.

View the provider policy table ( https://openrouter.ai/docs/features/privac=
y-and-logging?utm_source=3Demail&utm_medium=3Dlifecycle&utm_campaign=3Dcamp=
aign29&utm_content=3Dprivacy-trust&utm_campaign=3DOnboarding+Flow+-+v4+Apri=
l+2026&utm_content=3DA-Final+Privacy+Trust&utm_medium=3Demail_action&utm_so=
urce=3Dcustomer.io )

=E2=80=83

WHAT YOU CONTROL

1. Block routing to providers that train. Your privacy settings ( https://o=
penrouter.ai/settings/privacy?utm_campaign=3DOnboarding+Flow+-+v4+April+202=
6&utm_content=3DA-Final+Privacy+Trust&utm_medium=3Demail_action&utm_source=
=3Dcustomer.io ) have an account-wide toggle for whether routing may use pr=
oviders that train on prompts, with separate switches for paid and free mod=
els. If you opt out, OpenRouter will not route to training providers.

2. Require a specific data policy per request. You can override your accoun=
t default on any single call. See data policy filtering ( https://openroute=
r.ai/docs/features/provider-routing?utm_campaign=3DOnboarding+Flow+-+v4+Apr=
il+2026&utm_content=3DA-Final+Privacy+Trust&utm_medium=3Demail_action&utm_s=
ource=3Dcustomer.io#requiring-providers-to-comply-with-data-policies ) in t=
he provider routing docs.

3. Pick only zero-retention providers. Many providers on OpenRouter are zer=
o retention (Amazon Bedrock, Azure, Cerebras, DeepInfra, Google Vertex, Gro=
q, NVIDIA, SambaNova, Together, and others in the table). Filter to them th=
e same way as training policy.

=E2=80=83

IF YOU NEED STRICTER GUARANTEES

OpenRouter supports EU in-region routing for enterprise accounts. When enab=
led, prompts and completions are processed inside the European Union via th=
e https://eu.openrouter.ai base URL. Contact the enterprise team ( https://=
openrouter.ai/enterprise/form?utm_campaign=3DOnboarding+Flow+-+v4+April+202=
6&utm_content=3DA-Final+Privacy+Trust&utm_medium=3Demail_action&utm_source=
=3Dcustomer.io ) to enable it.

One API key, the same privacy controls across 300+ models.

